              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na amea, Nĩkwĩthĩwe kwĩanana na ndeto syenyu. Na amea mathi, namo maenda: nake ovelela ũlii mũtune mbũthinĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.2.21"
            ]
